<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans fell in Nov 13 week.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans fell in Nov 13 week.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED NOVEMBER 6</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............767,500 up.......300</p>
<p> Govt, agency securities...707,000 up.....3,200</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......469,200 down...3,700</p>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED NOVEMBER 13</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....751,397 down...4,793</p>
<p> Financial companies.......567,272 down...3,504</p>
<p> New York business loans....42,565 down.....422</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......42,303 down.....423</p>
</text>
